# Used ONLY when building this frontend to embed inside the Capacitor
# Android app. Do NOT set this for the normal Render web deploy — leaving
# it unset there keeps the existing relative '/api' same-origin behavior.
#
# Why it's needed: inside the Android APK there is no backend at the app's
# own origin (capacitor://localhost), so the frontend must call your Render
# backend's full URL instead of a relative path.
#
# How to use it:
#   1. Copy this file to frontend/.env.production
#   2. Set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your deployed Render URL (no trailing slash)
#   3. Run `npm run build` inside frontend/ — this build's dist/ output is
#      the one you copy/point Capacitor at (npx cap sync android)
#
# For the normal Render deploy, do NOT create a .env.production file at all.

VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-app.onrender.com
